 Prime Minister Narendra Modi, seeks to illuminate India's diverse civilizational heritage via displays and archaeological findings.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/humayun-sher-shah-and-one-fort-pakistan-minister-highlights-purana-quilas-layered-history-at-sco-forum/articleshow/136059561.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/humayun-sher-shah-and-one-fort-pakistan-minister-highlights-purana-quilas-layered-history-at-sco-forum/articleshow/136059561.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T22:55:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136059902,imgsize-87684.cms"/></item></channel></rss>